---
description: Drafts the team's daily stand-up from yesterday's work
automator.schedule: "15 9 * * 1-5"
automator.servers: [notify]
automator.parameters:
  - {name: team, type: string, default: Acme, description: The team the stand-up is for}
tools: [notify_me]
---
Draft {{team}}'s stand-up for {{today}}: what was done since {{since}}, and what's next.
Notify me with the draft.

{{> memories}}
